    {
      "id": 61,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        0,
        30
      ],
      "size": [
        640,
        360
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 5,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Realism pass: real skin texture, same face\n\nFeed it a finished generation. It upscales to ~2.4 MP and re-renders skin with a realism refiner, gives the face its own 1024px pass, then finishes like a phone camera.\n\nHer look is locked: only detail finer than ~3 px is taken from the refiner, so face shape, features, makeup, colors and light stay from your image. Eyes, lashes, brows and lips are masked out completely.\n\n**Before the first run**\n- Pick your file in **Character LoRA**.\n- Set her **real age** in both prompts (currently 25).\n\n**Needs:** comfyui-postfx; refiner (Realism by Stable Yogi v3.0), Krea 2 text encoder + VAE, mediapipe_face_fp32.\n\n**Output:** `output/realism/final_*.jpg`.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Realism pass: real skin texture, same face\n\nFeed it a finished generation. It upscales to ~2.4 MP and re-renders skin with a realism refiner, gives the face its own 1024px pass, then finishes like a phone camera.\n\nHer look is locked: only detail finer than ~3 px is taken from the refiner, so face shape, features, makeup, colors and light stay from your image. Eyes, lashes, brows and lips are masked out completely.\n\n**Before the first run**\n- Pick your file in **Character LoRA**.\n- Set her **real age** in both prompts (currently 25).\n\n**Needs:** comfyui-postfx; refiner (Realism by Stable Yogi v3.0), Krea 2 text encoder + VAE, mediapipe_face_fp32.\n\n**Output:** `output/realism/final_*.jpg`.\n"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        4152,
        612
      ],
      "size": [
        560,
        280
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Tuning",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Tuning\n\n- **Skin still too smooth** → *Detail Transfer* radius 4–5 on both, or *Texture pass* denoise 0.30.\n- **Texture too strong / aged** → *Detail Transfer* radius 2, or strength 0.7.\n- **Ghost edges or doubled hair strands** → lower that pass's denoise (0.2); the refine drifted out of alignment.\n- **Brow or lash edge changed** → *Protect* grow 0.18.\n- **Want texture on the lips too** → *Protect* lips = false.\n- **Grade** → *LUT grade* strength 0.3–0.5 (off by default so colors stay yours).\n- **Grain** → 0.2–0.4.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Tuning\n\n- **Skin still too smooth** → *Detail Transfer* radius 4–5 on both, or *Texture pass* denoise 0.30.\n- **Texture too strong / aged** → *Detail Transfer* radius 2, or strength 0.7.\n- **Ghost edges or doubled hair strands** → lower that pass's denoise (0.2); the refine drifted out of alignment.\n- **Brow or lash edge changed** → *Protect* grow 0.18.\n- **Want texture on the lips too** → *Protect* lips = false.\n- **Grade** → *LUT grade* strength 0.3–0.5 (off by default so colors stay yours).\n- **Grain** → 0.2–0.4.\n"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
